    "the estimators are correct where they were designed to work: single equities with 50-200 bps spreads recover at 0.9-1.0x.",
    "quoted spread only in any case -- market impact is never included.",
    "the qlib CSVs are split/dividend adjusted, which compresses historical high-low ranges and would bias these estimates low even if they resolved."
